# e4m2 E19 "e4m2_border" (docs/design/mission-e4-02.md, Cinematic hooks; script-episodes-4-8/e4m2.md 1): 30 s, then the
# victory. mode=pause over the live mission. Cinderwatch (Fire border fort): keep (-72, -10), gate zone (-66, 3); Ashby and
# his Flame Guards hold at (-60, 12); the road runs east from the gate: (-56, 6) (-40, 8) (-24, 0).
# 1) WS Cinderwatch's gate open, the last walkers passing under red banners, Ashby counting them in (map point: the gate);
# 2) MS Ashby and Ysolde, 3/4 (orbits the live `ashby`, MissionE402.ashby, who never leaves his hold spot: a capsule
# stand-in until Ashby has a model); 3) CU Wren handing her lantern to a Fire soldier (map point inside the gate: a small
# green glow); 4) WS Ysolde and Maelis turning east down the empty road, autumn leaves falling (map point: the road east
# of the gate; ember drift for the leaves). Axis: cameras stay SOUTH of the road / the Ashby - Ysolde pair.
# Lines: L26 (Ashby), L27 (Ysolde), L28 (Maelis), L29 (Ysolde) (mission DIALOGUE, French in dialogue.po).
# Fallback: the end state says L26-L29 as dialogue cards with a 2 s pan to the gate, then the victory.
cine e4m2_border  title="The Border"  mode=pause  letterbox=2.39  seed=83  length=28..32
env day  moon_yaw=120  moon_pitch=-24  energy=1.0
cast  ashby   capsule  at=(-60, 0, 12)  yaw=200
cast  ysolde  res://art/units/wizards/ysolde.tscn  at=(-58.5, 0, 9.5)  yaw=330
cast  maelis  res://art/units/helpers/helper_maelis/helper_maelis.tscn  at=(-55, 0, 7)  yaw=90

# WS the gate open, the last walkers under red banners, Ashby counting them in
shot B1 7.5  cam=dolly  from=(-50, 6, 16)  to=(-51, 5.5, 15)  look=(-66, 2, 3)>(-66, 2, 2)  fov=44>40  in=fade_black:0.8
  at 0.2  sfx res://assets/audio/forge/sfx/army_armour.wav  vol=-12
  at 1.0  vfx brazier  scene=res://art/cinematics/fx/ember.tscn  at=(-64, 3, 0)  life=6.0  scale=0.6
# MS Ashby and Ysolde, 3/4
shot B2 9.5  cam=orbit  pivot=ashby  r=4.8  h=1.6  deg=70>84
  at 0.3  line ashby "That's the lot, my lady. The border's yours whenever you want it. The queen said so."
  at 5.9  line ysolde "Thank her for me. And tell her I'm not staying."
# CU Wren's lantern passing to a Fire soldier inside the gate
shot B3 4.0  cam=dolly  from=(-61.5, 1.5, 7.0)  to=(-61.9, 1.5, 6.6)  look=(-64.5, 1.2, 4)>(-64.8, 1.3, 3.8)  fov=32>30
  at 0.4  vfx lantern  scene=res://art/cinematics/fx/green_pillar.tscn  at=(-64.5, 1.2, 4)  life=3.4  scale=0.12
  at 0.5  sfx res://assets/audio/sfx/item_pickup.wav  vol=-14
# WS Ysolde and Maelis turning east down the empty road, leaves falling
shot B4 9.0  cam=dolly  from=(-66, 3.0, 9)  to=(-65.2, 3.2, 8.6)  look=(-50, 1.2, 6)>(-44, 1.4, 7)  fov=42>40
  at 0.2  vfx leaves  scene=res://art/cinematics/fx/ember.tscn  at=(-54, 4, 7)  life=8.5  scale=1.2
  at 0.4  line maelis "The Sighing Wood, then? Burnt, frozen, and still ours."
  at 4.4  line ysolde "A seed doesn't wait for the war to end, Maelis. Neither do I."
  at 8.0  fade alpha=1 time=1.0
